   16           0060          BUFR=   0060                    /BUFFER POINTER [LAST LOCATION OF TEXT]
   17           3206          FRST=   3206                    /FIRST [PERMANENT] TEXT LINE HERE
   18           0031          LASTV=  0031                    /TOP OF VARIABLES POINTER [FOR TEXT]
