   44                 /       INTERNAL FORMAT OF FOCAL STATEMENTS.
   45   
   46                 /       WORD [0]        POINTER TO NEXT LINE (0000 IF LAST LINE).
   47   
   48                 /       WORD [1]        BITS[0-4] GROUP NUMBER, BITS[5-11] RELATIVE LINE NUMBER.
